---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { EMAIL, GITHUB_URL, X_URL, LINKEDIN_URL, OLD_PORTFOLIO_URL } from '../consts';
const links = [
  ['GitHub', GITHUB_URL, 'github.com/3zavalam'], ['X', X_URL, 'Coming soon'],
  ['LinkedIn', LINKEDIN_URL, 'emilio-zavala-miceli'], ['Old portfolio', OLD_PORTFOLIO_URL, 'portfolio-vercel'],
  ['Email', `mailto:${EMAIL}`, EMAIL],
];
---
<Base title="About" description="About Emilio Zavala Miceli: Computer Systems Engineer from México, heading to Valencia, Spain, and why the site is called Mansfield.">
  <section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden border-b border-stone-300 dark:border-stone-700">
    <p aria-hidden="true" class="serif pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 -z-10 select-none text-center text-[19vw] leading-[0.8] tracking-tight text-stone-200/80 sm:text-[7.6rem] dark:text-stone-800/70">MANSFIELD</p>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-[1fr_auto] items-end gap-4">
      <div class="pb-12 sm:pb-20">
        <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
        <h1 class="serif mt-4 text-4xl tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Hi, I'm Emilio.</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="relative flex items-end">
        <div aria-hidden="true" class="absolute -left-10 top-6 bottom-0 hidden flex-col items-center sm:flex">
          <div class="rounded-[4px] bg-accent px-3 py-1.5 text-white shadow-sm ring-2 ring-white ring-inset dark:bg-accent-dark dark:ring-night"><p class="text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em] opacity-90">Rue</p><p class="serif -mt-0.5 text-lg leading-none">Mansfield</p></div>
          <div class="w-1 flex-1 bg-stone-400 dark:bg-stone-600"></div>
        </div>
        <picture class="relative block w-32 sm:ml-16 sm:w-52"><source srcset="/images/emilio-cutout.webp" type="image/webp" /><img src="/images/emilio-cutout.png" alt="Flat illustration of Emilio Zavala Miceli in a black hoodie and shorts, white cap and blue sport glasses, taking a mirror selfie" width="577" height="898" class="w-full dark:[filter:drop-shadow(0_0_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.55))]" /></picture>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="mt-10 max-w-2xl space-y-5 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-stone-700 dark:text-stone-300">
    <p>I'm from México. I studied Computer Systems Engineering at UDLAP and graduated in 2026.</p>
    <p>I like turning messy data into something people can decide with: dashboards, predictive models, automations and small tools. Football and sports analytics pulled me in first; business is what I want to understand next.</p>
    <p>I've worked as a data analyst intern at RIANSA, a software developer intern at Piquero Technology and Sports, a research intern at INRS in Montreal (Mitacs Globalink), and now at Club León FC.</p>
    <p>In February 2027 I'm moving to Valencia, Spain, for a master's, and freelancing to pay for it.</p>
    <p>I work in Python, SQL, Pandas, Power BI, React and Flask, and I build a lot with AI tools. I speak Spanish natively and English professionally.</p>
    <h2 class="serif pt-4 text-2xl text-ink dark:text-stone-100">Why Mansfield</h2>
    <p>I was listening to the Acquired podcast episode on Microsoft and I liked the way they named things, so I was forcing myself to come up with one name like that (without using AI). I was at my last internship in Montreal, opened Maps, and saw that the street behind my work was called Mansfield. Not a fancy thing.</p>
    <h2 class="serif pt-4 text-2xl text-ink dark:text-stone-100">The dream</h2>
    <p>My dream is to live off what I like doing. I don't like the word job. I've been passionate about sports my entire life and I want to live thanks to that. In the last few years I found myself listening a lot to podcasts and videos about founders and companies, so maybe joining those two things is what I'd like. I like the idea of just living off what you like, no matter how much (as long as you can make a living). And to be honest, I lowkey always say that I will have a bunch of money.</p>
    <h2 class="serif pt-4 text-2xl text-ink dark:text-stone-100">Who I am</h2>
    <p>I'm just a guy who wants to learn, who overthinks way too much, and who sometimes doesn't feel like he deserves everything he has.</p>
  </div>
  <dl class="mt-12 divide-y divide-stone-200 border-y border-stone-200 dark:divide-stone-800 dark:border-stone-800">
    {links.map(([k, h, v]) => (
      <div class="flex justify-between gap-4 py-3.5 text-sm"><dt class="text-stone-500">{k}</dt><dd><a class="link" href={h}>{v}</a></dd></div>
    ))}
  </dl>
</Base>
